    "text": "keysweekly.com\nwebsite\nMonroe County, Florida\nSTATE REP. MOONEY, AIDE LEE YOUNG ARE HONORARY CONCHS\nBy The Weekly Staff,\n10 hours agoA pair of longtime Florida Keys residents who now spend their time advocating for the island chain in Tallahassee were recently recognized as Honorary Conchs. State Rep. Jim Mooney and legislative aide Lee Young obtained their certificates as Honorary Conchs during a July meeting of the Monroe County Commission. The special designation goes to individuals who weren’t born in Monroe County but have made significant contributions to enhancing the quality of life in the Keys.",
